    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "Doctor specifically asks about jaundice, dark urine, vomiting, and bleeding to screen for imminent danger signals.",
          "quote": "目前有黄疸、深色尿、发热、恶心呕吐或右上腹痛吗？近期是否饮酒，或用过对乙酰氨基酚、抗生素、中药/保健品？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor directly asked about jaundice, dark urine, vomiting, fever, abdominal pain, and bleeding. The patient reported no vomiting, no fever, no confusion, and only mild right upper quadrant discomfort. The doctor then gave explicit emergency escalation instructions if any of these red flags appear or worsen.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
