      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a concrete next-step plan: same-day or next-day hospital visit, with specific priority labs and a clear destination (ED if no outpatient option).",
          "quote": "建议今天或最迟明天到能验肝功能的医院就诊；先做一组关键检查：肝功能全套（ALT/AST、胆红素、白蛋白、ALP、GGT）、凝血功能/PT-INR、血常规、肾功能和乙肝/丙肝筛查"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor converted the risk into an actionable plan with a specific time window (today or next day), destination (hospital with lab capability, ED if outpatient not available), and priority tests (liver panel, coagulation, CBC, renal, hepatitis screen). Fallback was clearly stated: go to ED if outpatient cannot see you same day.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
