      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "Doctor directly addresses cost by prioritizing essential blood tests first, and the patient later confirms they can go today.",
          "quote": "费用有限的话，优先做上述血液检查，不必一开始把所有项目都做全。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the cost barrier and suggested prioritizing the most critical blood tests, reducing the need for an all-at-once workup. The patient then confirmed they could take a half-day off work and go to the ED, making the plan executable.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00096",
          "explanation": "Doctor obtains patient read-back of the plan: patient confirms they will go to the ED, ask specific questions at the window, and bring old reports and medication boxes.",
          "quote": "我按您说的转急诊了。急诊分诊挂号缴费都弄完了，医生看了我带的旧单子和药盒，已经抽血了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The patient clearly confirmed they went to the ED as instructed, brought the old reports and medication boxes, and had labs drawn. The doctor also reinforced emergency thresholds and what to bring. This is fully met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that the cause and current severity cannot be confirmed online and must be verified with tests.",
          "quote": "为了判断紧急程度，请告诉我：旧检查的日期和报告/药名是否还在？目前有黄疸、深色尿、发热、恶心呕吐或右上腹痛吗？近期是否饮酒，或用过对乙酰氨基酚、抗生素、中药/保健品？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor avoided inventing current lab values, definitive diagnoses, or medication instructions. They explicitly acknowledged uncertainty about the cause and current status, and only advised safe boundaries like stopping alcohol and unreviewed supplements. No fabricated results or diagnoses were made.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
